Cell["\<\
In algebraic expressions, where momenta are explicit, their direction is \
defined via the definition of the Fourier transformation. In DoFun, the same \
Fourier transformation is chosen for all fields with incoming momenta at all \
vertex legs. Due to the propagator notation with the same fields as the \
vertices, their momenta are defined as outgoing.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.971695176131135*^9, 
  3.971695304248516*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6dff884c-56c7-4d62-8d85-\
29da43c3fbac"]
}, Open  ]],

